WEBVTT

00:00:58.939 --> 00:01:02.119
Then he’ll have to choose 
any of the four numbers,

00:01:02.119 --> 00:01:06.443
and the process repeats until 
you can’t keep him inside the board

00:01:06.443 --> 00:01:07.933
with legal moves.

00:01:07.933 --> 00:01:12.894
Then he’ll break free of the spell 
and almost certainly kill you.

00:01:12.894 --> 00:01:18.206
What four numbers can you choose 
to keep MoldeVort trapped by your spell

00:01:18.206 --> 00:01:22.846
long enough for help to arrive? 
And what’s your strategy?

00:01:22.846 --> 00:01:24.926
Pause the video to figure it out yourself.

00:01:24.926 --> 00:01:25.726
Answer in 3

00:01:25.726 --> 00:01:27.371
Answer in 2

00:01:27.371 --> 00:01:29.571
Answer in 1

00:01:29.571 --> 00:01:32.841
The trick here is to keep MoldeVort 
where you want him.